# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback
# In a split deployment (Pages for frontend, separate Node backend for API),
# set VITE_API_BASE_URL at build time to the backend origin, e.g.:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.aurarudraksha.com/api
# /api/* paths are intentionally NOT rewritten so they either hit a Pages
# Function proxy (if you add one) or correctly fail over to the configured
# VITE_API_BASE_URL.
/*    /index.html   200
